      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELEGANT EMBER (1) has a strong record this trip with six wins and four placings from 16 starts. Hit the frame latest (19.92) when third at this track in a Grade 5. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. ATTENTION SEEKER (4) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (17.19) in a Other at Murray Bridge Straight. Solid record at the distance winning seven races. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. BINNAWAY SANDS (7) was below best last time finishing fifth at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Other win two back at Gawler. Expected to do much better this time. ADHANA ANNIE (8) will have admirers again after placing at this track and distance last time out.",
